4.0 Identification of Companies
The review of the literature had indicated that additive manufacturing was currently
being explored globally for various application, and also being investigated for heat
exchangers. One portion of this community is focused on developing new designs for
heat exchanger that may be produced using additive manufacturing, and these
conceptual designs dramatically depart from the traditional shell and tube.
Various companies were identified based on their research focus and history with
